{"nodes": [{"id": "developer_plan_dockwise", "label": "Dockwise Application", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "developer_plan_tech_stack", "label": "Declared Tech Stack (Vite+React TS / NestJS / SQLite-sql.js)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PRD/tech_stack.json declared Vite+React frontend, NestJS backend, PostgreSQL; database changed from PostgreSQL to SQLite via sql.js (pure-WASM, file-backed) per user direction during the run. NestJS conventions followed despite only node-express-typescript skill being available, since NestJS is a superset of Express patterns."}, {"id": "developer_plan_ui_design_decision", "label": "UI Design Decision (design-minimalist)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PRD \u00a78 mandates short, operational, dry tone for warehouse users at 05:30, no gamification, high-contrast sunlight-readable gate theme, 44px tap targets. Internal data-dense operational tool, so design-minimalist is the only fitting style; auto-selected because no human was reachable."}, {"id": "developer_plan_architecture", "label": "Inferred Monorepo Two-Tier Architecture", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No HLD/LLD exist; architecture INFERRED from PRD. Monorepo with backend (NestJS feature modules: auth, users, organizations, sites, appointments, visits, notifications, audit, reports) and frontend (api client, auth context, shared components, per-feature pages)."}, {"id": "developer_plan_authorization_model", "label": "Authorization Model (FR-ACCESS)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nine roles (platform_admin, site_admin, site_coordinator, gate_officer, dock_lead, tenant_admin, tenant_booker, carrier_dispatcher, auditor). memberships table joins users to organizations with a role. Every list/detail API enforces org+role scope; tampered tenant_id returns 403 not empty 200 (FR-ACCESS-10)."}, {"id": "developer_plan_no_double_booking", "label": "No Double-Booking Invariant (G-02/RG-02)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A confirmed appointment consumes door interval + buffer. Enforced in DB via exclusion constraint on tstzrange per door plus service-level availability check (FR-CONFIG-07)."}, {"id": "developer_plan_auto_confirm", "label": "Auto-Confirm Rule (FR-CONFIG-09)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In-hours leased-door bookings auto-confirm when free; pool doors and after-hours go to requested status."}, {"id": "developer_plan_multi_site", "label": "Multi-Site From Sprint 1", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every relevant entity carries site_id so multi-site support is built in from the start rather than retrofitted."}, {"id": "developer_plan_confirmation_codes", "label": "Confirmation Codes (FR-APPT-09)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unguessable human-readable codes, 6-8 chars, no ambiguous letters."}, {"id": "developer_plan_detention_display", "label": "Detention Display-Only Estimate (FR-VISIT-05/06)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Detention is a display-only estimate labeled 'Not an invoice. For discussion only.' Billable minutes = max(0, clock stop - clock start - free time) minus pauses; only coordinators may pause (site_fault), tenants get 403."}, {"id": "developer_plan_scope_notes", "label": "V1 Scope Boundary (PRD \u00a77)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deferred: .ics attachments, historical CSV import, Entra ID SSO (stubbed behind config flag), real SMS/email delivery (logged to outbox + console). MFA enforced as required flag on privileged roles with TOTP stub."}, {"id": "developer_plan_scaffold_auth", "label": "Slice 1: scaffold-auth", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "developer_plan_site_config", "label": "Slice 2: site-config", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "developer_plan_appointment_booking", "label": "Slice 3: appointment-booking", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "developer_plan_coordinator_queue", "label": "Slice 4: coordinator-queue", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "developer_plan_live_board", "label": "Slice 5: live-board", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PLAN.md", "source_l